1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,520
Hi everyone. In this quick video, we'll

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,600
look at a small but powerful shortcut in

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,080
Blitzet. Add an estimated time directly

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,800
in the task name. Normally, when

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,200
creating a task, you type the title and

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,200
then add the estimated time in the ST

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,920
field. But Blitz now gives you a new way

8
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,080
to do this. Just type the time at the

9
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,400
end of your task description and Blitz

10
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,920
will automatically parse it into the

11
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,519
estimated time field. For example, if I

12
00:00:27,519 --> 00:00:31,679
type prepare slides 28 m, blit set field

13
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:35,360
to 28 minutes. If I type write blog post

14
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:39,840
1 HR, this field shows 1 hour. If I type

15
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:44,480
email campaign to HR 15 m, this field

16
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:47,920
shows 2 hours and 15 minutes. So to set

17
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,840
minutes, just write the number followed

18
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:53,199
by MIN. And to set hours, write the

19
00:00:53,199 --> 00:00:55,920
number and either HR or the full word

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,559
hours. And if you ever need to adjust

21
00:00:58,559 --> 00:01:00,879
it, you can still add it or remove the

22
00:01:00,879 --> 00:01:04,000
time in the SD field as usual. This

23
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,840
little shortcut makes task creation

24
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,600
smoother and saves you clicks,

25
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,960
especially when you're creating lots of

26
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:12,240
tasks at once. Thanks for watching and

27
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,760
don't forget to check out our other

28
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,520
tutorials and join our Discord

29
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:18,240
community. Happy blitzing.

30
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:21,440
[Music]